== D7: started without the sandbox (the root resolves against the process directory)
CASE c04-valid-set (nosandbox)
CONFIG {"root":".motoko/skills","skills":[],"sandbox_set":false}
REFUSAL <none>
CAPS 2
CAP DescribeTools: one schema, name=Skill description_chars=144
DESCRIPTION Load a skill by name. No skills are installed in this workspace (.motoko/skills holds none), so there is nothing to load. Do not call this tool.
PARAMETERS {"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the skill to load."}},"required":["name"]}
CAP ToolProvider names=[Skill]
LISTDIR <root is not a directory>
CALL workdir-stamp workdir=. limit=0 => tool=Skill exit_code=1 stdout_chars=0 stdout_line1=[] stderr=[Unknown skill 'workdir-stamp'. No skills are installed in this workspace (.motoko/skills holds none).]
EXIT 0

